'''Christopher Jude Sedoris''' (born April 25, 1973) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[Center (gridiron football)|center]] for the [[Washington Redskins]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[Purdue Boilermakers football|Purdue Boilermakers]].<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.pro-football-reference.com/players/S/SedoCh20.htm | title=Chris Sedoris Stats, Height, Weight, Position, Draft, College | website=[[Pro-Football-Reference.com]] }}</ref>
